{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/app-deploy/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Yerin Blog"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"e4e49b53-277f-5212-8ed9-fc02760629c1","excerpt":"Ready to deploy 1. Android To generate key on mac silicon device, you need to download java first. Missing Symbol files \nCompress the folders under “build/app…","html":"<h1>Ready to deploy</h1>\n<h2>1. Android</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">android {\n    ...\n    buildTypes {\n        release {\n            shrinkResources true\n            minifyEnabled true\n            proguardFiles getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android.txt'),\n                'proguard-rules.pro'\n        }\n    }\n}</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">flutter build appbundle <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--release</span> lib/main_production.dart <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--flavor</span> production</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>To generate key on mac silicon device, you need to download java first.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">brew <span class=\"token function\">install</span> <span class=\"token function\">java</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">sudo</span> <span class=\"token function\">ln</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-sfn</span> /opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk/libexec/openjdk.jdk /Library/Java/JavaVirtualMachines/openjdk.jdk\n<span class=\"token builtin class-name\">echo</span> <span class=\"token string\">'export PATH=\"/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk/bin:$PATH\"'</span> <span class=\"token operator\">>></span> ~/.zshrc\n<span class=\"token builtin class-name\">export</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">CPPFLAGS</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"-I/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk/include\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Missing Symbol files</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/00b70/compress_native_lib.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.0379746835443%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Compress\"\n        title=\"Compress\"\n        src=\"/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/f058b/compress_native_lib.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/c26ae/compress_native_lib.png 158w,\n/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/6bdcf/compress_native_lib.png 315w,\n/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/f058b/compress_native_lib.png 630w,\n/static/1b31a9b96d9f2958d6022a1f2b5bbaaa/00b70/compress_native_lib.png 733w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\nCompress the folders under “build/app/intermediates/merged_native_libs/productionRelease/out/lib”.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/84d4d/symbol_files_android.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 55.06329113924051%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Symbol files are missing\"\n        title=\"Symbol files are missing\"\n        src=\"/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/f058b/symbol_files_android.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/c26ae/symbol_files_android.png 158w,\n/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/6bdcf/symbol_files_android.png 315w,\n/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/f058b/symbol_files_android.png 630w,\n/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/40601/symbol_files_android.png 945w,\n/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/78612/symbol_files_android.png 1260w,\n/static/2b5e4687a43793e6cf30c977cac59f25/84d4d/symbol_files_android.png 2996w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h2>2. iOS</h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sh\"><pre class=\"language-sh\"><code class=\"language-sh\">flutter build ipa <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--release</span> lib/main_production.dart <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--flavor</span> production <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--obfuscate</span> --split-debug-info --export-method ad-hoc</code></pre></div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://docs.flutter.dev/deployment/ios#upload-the-app-bundle-to-app-store-connect\"><strong>Upload the app bundle</strong></a></h3>\n<p>Once the app bundle is created, upload it to App Store Connect by either:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Install and open the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/transporter/id1450874784\">Apple Transport macOS app</a>. Drag and drop the build/ios/ipa/*.ipa app bundle into the app.</li>\n<li>Or upload the app bundle from the command line by running:</li>\n<li>Or open build/ios/archive/MyApp.xcarchive in Xcode.</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/transporter/id1450874784\">Transport macOS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/e216b/transport_issues.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 78.48101265822784%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Transport issues\"\n        title=\"Transport issues\"\n        src=\"/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/f058b/transport_issues.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/c26ae/transport_issues.png 158w,\n/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/6bdcf/transport_issues.png 315w,\n/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/f058b/transport_issues.png 630w,\n/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/40601/transport_issues.png 945w,\n/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/78612/transport_issues.png 1260w,\n/static/7b57f54a71549810eac7a4126be41143/e216b/transport_issues.png 1904w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n<span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; mar