th: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<h3><a href=\"https://testflight.apple.com/\"><strong>Test flight</strong></a></h3>\n<p>Tester can redeem with a code sended by the registered email and download on any devices.</p>\n<h2>Refs.</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Android/iOS obfuscation\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/62568757/playstore-error-app-bundle-contains-native-code-and-youve-not-uploaded-debug\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/62568757/playstore-error-app-bundle-contains-native-code-and-youve-not-uploaded-debug</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9848633?hl=en#zippy=%2Cupload-files-using-play-console\">https://support.google.com/googleplay/android-developer/answer/9848633?hl=en#zippy=%2Cupload-files-using-play-console</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://yagom.net/forums/topic/%EC%95%B1-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%EC%A6%88-%EC%A4%84%EC%9D%B4%EA%B8%B0/\">https://yagom.net/forums/topic/%EC%95%B1-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%EC%A6%88-%EC%A4%84%EC%9D%B4%EA%B8%B0/</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>iPad multitasking issue - Transporter\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/19215\">https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/19215</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/32559724/ipad-multitasking-support-requires-these-orientations/32728607#32728607\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/32559724/ipad-multitasking-support-requires-these-orientations/32728607#32728607</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Alpha channel remove\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46585809/error-itms-90717-invalid-app-store-icon\">https://stackoverflow.com/questions/46585809/error-itms-90717-invalid-app-store-icon</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Missing compliance\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://medium.com/@iamCoder/how-to-solve-missing-compliance-status-in-testflight-and-invites-not-coming-to-testers-4cbbe3c4ed12\">https://medium.com/@iamCoder/how-to-solve-missing-compliance-status-in-testflight-and-invites-not-coming-to-testers-4cbbe3c4ed12</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>","frontmatter":{"title":"Deploy Android & iOS applications","date":"February 20, 2023","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/flutter-3-7-0/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Flutter update to 3.7.0 (flutter_intl generate failure)"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/design-resouces/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Design Resources"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"e4e49b53-277f-5212-8ed9-fc02760629c1","previousPostId":"550b2a05-2621-58e7-a809-155973e1039d","nextPostId":"2af91ec4-fe93-5bb0-b680-ea5bff86a04c"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383","3257411868"]}